WEBVTT

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:34.069
Respect our Indigenous people's
cultural integrity.

00:09:34.111 --> 00:09:36.447
It has worked for many centuries.

00:09:37.615 --> 00:09:40.868
The third “R” ...

00:09:40.868 --> 00:09:42.036
relationship,

00:09:42.077 --> 00:09:46.373
the third “R,” relationship,
is about Indigenous people’s relationship

00:09:46.373 --> 00:09:48.208
with their ancestral land.

00:09:50.002 --> 00:09:53.964
Engaging with indigenous communities ...

00:09:54.006 --> 00:09:57.718
it’s very important to understand
the nature of the relationship

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:02.598
among ancestral lands,
cultures and spirituality.